<p>		     1.2662/72  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     31.71/73   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.2027/37  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1540.2/1.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     112.05/10  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.6424/99  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5312/32  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.8979/99  Danish Crowns</p>
